{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216020","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1721602001:0":{"text":"司令，您回来了。上城区的护卫任务还顺利吗？","source_cn":"司令，您回来了。上城区的护卫任务还顺利吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1396290F2DFCFDF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721602002:0":{"text":"王子殿下已安全返回王宫。我也加强了那边的巡防。我记得你今日调休，还没回家吗？","source_cn":"王子殿下已安全返回王宫。我也加强了那边的巡防。我记得你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F79FB4460F8A9A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721602003:0":{"text":"……父亲，我想跟你谈谈圣古堂和佩吉的失踪案，我请求参与调查！","source_cn":"……父亲，我想跟你谈谈圣古堂和佩吉的失踪案，我请求参与调查！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F9015A7CB848053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721602004:2":{"text":"我记得我在王宫里已经说得很清楚了，这件事由我和梅林阁下负责，与你无关。","source_cn":"我记得我在王宫里已经说得很清楚了，这件事由我和梅林阁下...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF851005BEC5A963E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我记得我在王宫里已经说得很清楚了，这件事由我和梅林阁下负责，与你无关。","female":"我记得我在王宫里已经说得很清楚了，这件事由我和梅林阁下负责，与你无关。","variant_male_record_index":"229400","variant_female_record_index":"229401","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721602005:0":{"text":"你的任务是待在驻地，处理日常治安事件。怎么？我的命令现在已经不作数了吗？","source_cn":"你的任务是待在驻地，处理日常治安事件。怎么？我的命令现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAADD38D0630A72F","variant_sta